  "body_html": "<h1>Belief System</h1>\n<p>A belief system assigns to each information set $Q_i$ a probability distribution\n$\\mu(Q_i)$ over the nodes of $Q_i$. Given beliefs and a behavioral profile, a\nplayer can evaluate expected continuation payoff for each action available at the\ninformation set.</p>",
